1
00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:40,800
[Her Willing Subject]

2
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:43,680
[Episode 2]

3
00:00:47,520 --> 00:00:48,920
I will never marry Lu Qingcang.

4
00:00:51,670 --> 00:00:53,790
This betrothal was settled
when you were children.

5
00:00:53,790 --> 00:00:54,920
You will not make a scene over it.

6
00:00:56,280 --> 00:00:57,920
Lu Qingcang's father, Lu Yuanshan,

7
00:00:57,920 --> 00:00:59,110
founded the Iron Cavalry,

8
00:00:59,320 --> 00:01:00,710
and was Empress Lu's brother.

9
00:01:00,840 --> 00:01:02,110
The family was glorious back then.

10
00:01:02,110 --> 00:01:04,000
But Empress Lu has been dead
for twenty years now.

11
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:05,840
Now they are long forgotten. Lu...

12
00:01:06,840 --> 00:01:07,640
Ying'er.

13
00:01:07,790 --> 00:01:10,310
Your husband can only be Lu Qingcang.

14
00:01:10,510 --> 00:01:11,310
Father!

15
00:01:11,870 --> 00:01:13,310
Why is it that since Lu Qingcang
came back,

16
00:01:13,310 --> 00:01:14,790
you seem like a different person?

17
00:01:17,310 --> 00:01:18,640
Seal the young lady's door.

18
00:01:18,870 --> 00:01:20,870
She stays confined until she marries.

19
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:29,400
In your dreams.

20
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:32,230
The only one
who decides my life

21
00:01:32,480 --> 00:01:33,790
is me, Shen Shuying.

22
00:01:36,920 --> 00:01:37,710
Lingxi.

23
00:01:38,200 --> 00:01:39,790
That dog hole I had you prepare
yesterday,

24
00:01:39,920 --> 00:01:40,870
how is it coming along?

25
00:01:40,920 --> 00:01:42,120
It's ready, My Lady.

26
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:44,400
Good thing we prepared
an escape route in advance.

27
00:01:44,710 --> 00:01:45,510
But

28
00:01:45,760 --> 00:01:47,510
defying the Master like this,

29
00:01:47,590 --> 00:01:48,680
is it really all right?

30
00:01:48,790 --> 00:01:50,790
I will forgive his ignorance for now.

31
00:01:50,870 --> 00:01:53,310
But before long, he will see

32
00:01:54,430 --> 00:01:56,790
that I'm the savior of
the Chancellor's house.

33
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:01,790
My Lady.

34
00:02:02,070 --> 00:02:03,400
Since yesterday,

35
00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:05,070
I have felt you're
completely different.

36
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:08,190
That corpse is still in the dog kennel.

37
00:02:08,520 --> 00:02:10,430
The Chancellor's house draws envy.

38
00:02:10,590 --> 00:02:12,400
And unlike the General's house,
it holds no real power.

39
00:02:12,630 --> 00:02:13,430
So

40
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:15,870
I must find a more powerful backer.

41
00:02:15,870 --> 00:02:17,190
A more powerful backer?

42
00:02:18,080 --> 00:02:19,520
The future emperor,

43
00:02:20,310 --> 00:02:21,430
the Eighth Prince.

44
00:02:22,080 --> 00:02:24,190
I will make the Eighth Prince
ask for my hand.

45
00:02:24,430 --> 00:02:27,120
But the Eighth Prince is
His Majesty's only child.

46
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:28,840
His marriage is a matter of state.

47
00:02:28,910 --> 00:02:30,520
Why would he ask for you?

48
00:02:30,870 --> 00:02:32,710
If the Eighth Prince would
just see me once,

49
00:02:32,710 --> 00:02:34,680
I will make him unable to resist me.

50
00:02:35,520 --> 00:02:37,400
But we don't even know

51
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:38,710
where the Eighth Prince is.

52
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:40,710
Where else would he be?

53
00:02:41,590 --> 00:02:43,710
[The Music Bureau]
He haunts the Music Bureau daily.

54
00:02:44,910 --> 00:02:45,710
My Lady,

55
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:46,870
it is royal ground.

56
00:02:46,870 --> 00:02:48,400
We cannot simply walk in.

57
00:02:48,910 --> 00:02:50,870
I know the steward here well.

58
00:02:51,190 --> 00:02:52,400
He is greedy for money.

59
00:02:52,710 --> 00:02:54,000
A small bribe will do.

60
00:02:57,630 --> 00:03:00,080
How does she know all these things?

61
00:03:00,280 --> 00:03:04,280
[The Music Bureau]

62
00:03:09,030 --> 00:03:11,080
In my last life, the Chancellor's
house was clearly confiscated.

63
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:13,120
Now it stands untouched.

64
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:15,840
Shen Shuying may
have been reborn too.

65
00:03:16,120 --> 00:03:17,630
Given how she never concedes,

66
00:03:18,030 --> 00:03:18,840
after rebirth,

67
00:03:18,910 --> 00:03:21,000
her first move would be
to find the Eighth Prince.

68
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:21,800
Young Master.

69
00:03:22,080 --> 00:03:24,710
Do you really think she will come
for the Eighth Prince?

70
00:03:25,400 --> 00:03:26,680
In my last life, Shen Shuying

71
00:03:26,680 --> 00:03:28,870
attached herself to him right here.

72
00:03:29,400 --> 00:03:30,910
I only need to wait here.

73
00:03:31,120 --> 00:03:32,800
She will reveal her hand.

74
00:03:33,910 --> 00:03:34,870
I understand.

75
00:03:34,910 --> 00:03:35,680
Young Master.

76
00:03:35,680 --> 00:03:37,430
You must be worried that Miss Shen,

77
00:03:37,520 --> 00:03:38,910
while you were on campaign,

78
00:03:39,120 --> 00:03:40,190
would stray.

79
00:03:44,030 --> 00:03:45,520
Young Master, rest assured.

80
00:03:45,590 --> 00:03:46,710
I owe you my life.

81
00:03:46,710 --> 00:03:48,030
If she is disloyal to you,

82
00:03:48,030 --> 00:03:49,870
I will kill her, even at the
cost of my life.

83
00:03:52,520 --> 00:03:53,710
This is not a military camp.

84
00:03:53,870 --> 00:03:55,310
This is the Eighth Prince's ground.

85
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:58,590
If this is found, it means death.

86
00:03:59,080 --> 00:04:00,630
If she ever turns against you,

87
00:04:00,630 --> 00:04:01,680
I will not spare her!

88
00:04:03,520 --> 00:04:04,910
Take this and get out, now.

89
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:10,280
Sir, someone offers you a dance.

90
00:04:10,310 --> 00:04:10,960
Hide.

91
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:15,870
Here.

92
00:04:16,830 --> 00:04:17,270
Okay.

93
00:04:55,190 --> 00:04:56,310
The Young Master was right.

94
00:04:56,920 --> 00:04:58,270
It is that malicious woman.

95
00:05:24,430 --> 00:05:25,720
Zhuren. Zhuren!

96
00:05:26,390 --> 00:05:27,390
That wretch.

97
00:05:27,830 --> 00:05:29,510
She means to cuckold the General.

98
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:52,920
Don't be afraid. I mean you no harm.

99
00:05:53,310 --> 00:05:55,270
I am your future wife.

100
00:05:56,310 --> 00:05:57,430
Future...

101
00:05:58,120 --> 00:05:59,310
wife?

102
00:06:03,390 --> 00:06:03,950
Lu...

103
00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:06,560
Lu Qingcang?

104
00:06:07,390 --> 00:06:08,390
Shen Shuying.

105
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:11,510
So you really were reborn.

106
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:22,680
Are you killing me again?

107
00:06:24,430 --> 00:06:25,310
Lu Qingcang...

108
00:06:25,870 --> 00:06:26,920
He has been reborn.

109
00:06:27,070 --> 00:06:28,720
That gust just now was an arrow.

110
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:29,870
He wanted to kill me.

111
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:33,720
Lu Qingcang is at the Music Bureau?

112
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:34,870
Absolutely true.

113
00:06:35,070 --> 00:06:37,720
The marriage of Shuying and Qingcang
should not be delayed.

114
00:06:37,720 --> 00:06:38,720
Brother Lu is not here.

115
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:40,720
I treat Qingcang as my own son.

116
00:06:41,390 --> 00:06:42,720
As for the betrothal gifts,

117
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:44,480
keep everything simple.

118
00:06:44,480 --> 00:06:45,120
Yes.

119
00:06:45,870 --> 00:06:48,430
General, what did you just say?

120
00:06:48,510 --> 00:06:49,310
What...

121
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:51,800
What rebirth?

122
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:56,830
I feared I would not look
presentable for you,

123
00:06:57,240 --> 00:06:58,630
so I was only fixing my appearance.

124
00:07:00,310 --> 00:07:02,720
This is the room the Eighth Prince
keeps year-round.

125
00:07:03,070 --> 00:07:04,310
You came here to see me?

126
00:07:05,310 --> 00:07:06,120
I...

127
00:07:08,430 --> 00:07:10,120
I made a point of finding out
you were here.

128
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:11,920
I am your future wife.

129
00:07:12,830 --> 00:07:14,600
My future wife?

130
00:07:15,600 --> 00:07:18,120
General, have you forgotten

131
00:07:18,600 --> 00:07:19,920
our betrothal?

132
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:23,720
Then why did you come to me?

133
00:07:24,560 --> 00:07:25,360
Just...

134
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:28,070
to see you.

135
00:07:29,270 --> 00:07:30,720
These words of yours,

136
00:07:31,830 --> 00:07:33,190
do you believe them yourself?

137
00:07:34,510 --> 00:07:36,070
Chancellor, this is the place.

138
00:07:36,440 --> 00:07:39,240
[The Music Bureau]

139
00:07:41,070 --> 00:07:42,680
Now that you have seen it,

140
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:43,680
I

141
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:45,120
will head home first.

142
00:07:49,510 --> 00:07:50,310
Ying'er.

143
00:07:50,720 --> 00:07:51,510
Father?

144
00:07:54,190 --> 00:07:57,190
Did you slip out to break off
your betrothal to Qingcang?

145
00:07:57,190 --> 00:07:58,000
I...

146
00:08:01,600 --> 00:08:02,720
All that talk of devotion,

147
00:08:03,310 --> 00:08:04,800
and you came to break it off.

148
00:08:06,310 --> 00:08:08,360
Or do you mean to marry
the Eighth Prince instead?

149
00:08:10,430 --> 00:08:11,430
What Eighth Prince?

150
00:08:11,480 --> 00:08:12,630
What has anyone else to do with it?

151
00:08:12,630 --> 00:08:14,270
Do not make excuses for your
own mistakes!

152
00:08:14,480 --> 00:08:14,830
You...

153
00:08:14,830 --> 00:08:15,510
Father.

154
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:17,480
I came to catch him in the act.

155
00:08:17,680 --> 00:08:18,310
What?

156
00:08:18,390 --> 00:08:20,720
Lu Qingcang has been unfaithful to me.

157
00:08:21,870 --> 00:08:23,630
He is hiding a beauty in there.

158
00:08:28,040 --> 00:08:29,040
Lu Qingcang.

159
00:08:29,240 --> 00:08:30,870
You meant to kill me just now,
didn't you?

160
00:08:30,950 --> 00:08:33,000
Carrying a weapon on the Eighth
Prince's ground.

161
00:08:33,030 --> 00:08:34,600
I will see you reap what you sowed.

162
00:08:37,080 --> 00:08:37,750
She's...

163
00:08:38,390 --> 00:08:39,120
talking nonsense!

164
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:40,320
If you would prove yourself,

165
00:08:40,630 --> 00:08:42,030
then take us inside to look.

166
00:08:42,030 --> 00:08:44,080
Let us see whether a beauty is
hidden inside.

167
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:46,910
Qingcang.

168
00:08:47,480 --> 00:08:48,720
All men have their fancies.

169
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:50,510
Those women of yours,

170
00:08:50,720 --> 00:08:52,390
as long as you cut ties today,

171
00:08:52,480 --> 00:08:54,270
I will let bygones be bygones.

172
00:08:55,510 --> 00:08:56,200
Father!

173
00:09:01,670 --> 00:09:03,630
If you will not cut them, I will.

174
00:09:20,390 --> 00:09:21,200
Chancellor Shen,

175
00:09:21,510 --> 00:09:23,000
the one inside is my true love.

176
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:24,720
In this life I will marry no one else.

177
00:09:24,750 --> 00:09:25,790
Father.

178
00:09:26,120 --> 00:09:27,320
It is not that I will not marry.

179
00:09:27,440 --> 00:09:28,440
It is that he will not have me.

180
00:09:30,120 --> 00:09:31,240
Lu Qingcang.

181
00:09:32,320 --> 00:09:33,720
You are being a fool!

182
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:35,510
My mind is made up.

183
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:37,120
It will not change.

184
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:39,870
Father, his mind is made up.

185
00:09:40,440 --> 00:09:41,240
Must we...

186
00:09:41,270 --> 00:09:42,720
Must we stay here and be shamed?

187
00:09:46,030 --> 00:09:47,080
Lu Qingcang.

188
00:09:47,910 --> 00:09:49,440
Think it over, carefully.

189
00:09:50,510 --> 00:09:51,320
Let's go.

190
00:10:04,870 --> 00:10:05,440
Come out!

191
00:10:07,480 --> 00:10:08,200
Young Master.

192
00:10:08,200 --> 00:10:09,720
So Miss Shen was not trying
to cuckold you,

193
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:10,910
she actually cares for you!

194
00:10:12,510 --> 00:10:14,080
But Young Master, to save me,

195
00:10:14,240 --> 00:10:15,720
you gave up being the Chancellor's
son-in-law.

196
00:10:16,320 --> 00:10:18,440
I would walk through fire
for you.

197
00:10:24,240 --> 00:10:25,510
Young Master!

198
00:10:28,630 --> 00:10:29,720
That Lu Qingcang

199
00:10:30,030 --> 00:10:31,270
was waiting there to kill me.

200
00:10:31,270 --> 00:10:32,600
If I had not improvised,

201
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:33,910
I would have died right there.

202
00:10:34,030 --> 00:10:36,320
So do we still seek the Eighth Prince?

203
00:10:39,030 --> 00:10:40,000
Now more than ever.

204
00:10:40,440 --> 00:10:43,120
But Lu Qingcang will be watching me.

205
00:10:43,840 --> 00:10:45,080
Then what do we do?

206
00:10:52,720 --> 00:10:54,670
We do it right in front
of Lu Qingcang

207
00:10:54,910 --> 00:10:56,390
and search in the open.

208
00:10:59,390 --> 00:11:00,910
When Lu Qingcang returns
in triumph,

209
00:11:01,120 --> 00:11:03,320
the Imperial Garden will host
a victory feast.

210
00:11:03,510 --> 00:11:06,240
The Eighth Prince will reward
the troops for His Majesty.

211
00:11:06,630 --> 00:11:08,080
My father will attend as well.

212
00:11:08,480 --> 00:11:10,320
But the Chancellor is furious now.

213
00:11:10,390 --> 00:11:12,000
Why would he bring you along?

214
00:11:25,030 --> 00:11:27,080
You truly cannot let Lu Qingcang go?

215
00:11:29,670 --> 00:11:32,240
He is handsome and laden with
battle honors,

216
00:11:32,240 --> 00:11:33,270
a fine match indeed.

217
00:11:33,720 --> 00:11:35,200
So what if a man has his fancies?

218
00:11:35,670 --> 00:11:37,120
As long as he mends his ways,
it's fine.

219
00:11:37,120 --> 00:11:37,840
Good.

220
00:11:37,910 --> 00:11:39,910
It is enough that you see reason.

221
00:11:40,840 --> 00:11:41,910
Father, rest assured,

222
00:11:42,030 --> 00:11:43,600
I will not disappoint you.

223
00:11:44,120 --> 00:11:46,120
Minister Shen, long time no see!

224
00:11:47,510 --> 00:11:48,390
Minister Wang.

225
00:11:48,480 --> 00:11:50,000
Come, let us have a few more cups.

226
00:11:50,240 --> 00:11:51,030
Let's go.

227
00:11:59,510 --> 00:12:01,510
This is my only chance to get
close to the Eighth Prince.

228
00:12:01,910 --> 00:12:05,000
From the Eighth Prince's palace to
the garden, this is the only road.

229
00:12:05,440 --> 00:12:07,720
I must reach Xiao Ningze before
Lu Qingcang does.

230
00:12:10,360 --> 00:12:13,920
[Xiao Ningze, Eighth Prince of Dasheng]

231
00:12:23,240 --> 00:12:24,510
Greetings, Your Highness.

232
00:12:25,480 --> 00:12:26,870
Which family's noble lady is this?

233
00:12:29,510 --> 00:12:31,510
This is my betrothed,

234
00:12:32,240 --> 00:12:34,030
Shen Shuying, the Chancellor's daughter.

235
00:12:37,870 --> 00:12:39,200
That fleeting glimpse just now

236
00:12:39,320 --> 00:12:40,320
was truly breathtaking.

237
00:12:40,550 --> 00:12:41,360
So

238
00:12:41,840 --> 00:12:42,790
the beauty is already claimed.

239
00:12:43,390 --> 00:12:46,080
I am Lu Qingcang. Greetings,
Your Highness.

240
00:12:46,840 --> 00:12:47,870
You have served the realm well.

241
00:12:48,030 --> 00:12:48,910
No need for such formality.

242
00:12:49,440 --> 00:12:50,870
Your Highness misunderstands.

243
00:12:51,320 --> 00:12:54,600
A few days ago General Lu,
for the sake of his beloved,

244
00:12:54,910 --> 00:12:56,270
broke off our engagement.

245
00:12:57,870 --> 00:12:59,870
To set aside a lady like Miss Shen,

246
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:02,320
General Lu must have someone else.

247
00:13:02,390 --> 00:13:04,080
Yet Miss Shen

248
00:13:04,440 --> 00:13:07,000
has clung to me without shame.

249
00:13:07,240 --> 00:13:08,550
I am rather moved, in fact.

250
00:13:08,550 --> 00:13:11,080
But General Lu's heart is iron.

251
00:13:11,080 --> 00:13:11,960
Impossible to move.

252
00:13:11,960 --> 00:13:13,120
That may not be so.

253
00:13:13,600 --> 00:13:16,790
Miss Shen's devotion runs deep;
water wears through stone.

254
00:13:16,790 --> 00:13:18,240
Yet it cannot beat the flower's will

255
00:13:18,320 --> 00:13:19,390
against the heartless stream.

256
00:13:23,510 --> 00:13:25,080
Your Highness, the feast is beginning.

257
00:13:27,120 --> 00:13:28,120
Please take your seat.

258
00:13:35,440 --> 00:13:37,120
Your father asked me to look after you.

259
00:13:37,320 --> 00:13:39,510
You did not come today for me.

260
00:13:39,510 --> 00:13:41,030
You came for the Eighth Prince.

261
00:13:42,120 --> 00:13:43,510
General Lu, you misunderstood.

262
00:13:43,910 --> 00:13:46,320
I have never met the Eighth Prince.

263
00:13:47,720 --> 00:13:48,910
The feast is about to begin.

264
00:13:49,440 --> 00:13:50,440
Best hurry over.

265
00:13:55,720 --> 00:13:57,440
Right before my eyes,

266
00:13:58,000 --> 00:13:59,510
I will learn whom you came to see.

267
00:14:00,030 --> 00:14:01,480
And whether you were reborn.

268
00:14:26,630 --> 00:14:27,440
General Lu,

269
00:14:27,910 --> 00:14:29,120
keeping a beauty hidden, I see.

270
00:14:29,790 --> 00:14:31,910
Why have I never met Miss Shen before?

271
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:34,790
Your Highness,

272
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:36,480
I have been at war for years.

273
00:14:36,510 --> 00:14:38,390
I never had the chance to bring
Shuying to pay her respects.

274
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:39,240
No matter.

275
00:14:39,270 --> 00:14:41,910
You must visit my residence more often.

276
00:14:42,240 --> 00:14:43,720
Your Highness is burdened with affairs.

277
00:14:44,120 --> 00:14:45,120
I would not presume.

278
00:14:48,440 --> 00:14:49,270
General Lu,

279
00:14:49,510 --> 00:14:51,600
it seems you and this Miss Shen

280
00:14:51,600 --> 00:14:52,720
are quite devoted.

281
00:14:55,720 --> 00:14:56,510
Here.

282
00:14:56,720 --> 00:14:59,600
I cannot hold my liquor.
I must decline.

283
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:00,790
General Lu,

284
00:15:00,790 --> 00:15:02,480
I was just praising you.

285
00:15:02,480 --> 00:15:03,840
Miss Shen has just said

286
00:15:03,840 --> 00:15:04,910
that she cannot hold her liquor,

287
00:15:04,910 --> 00:15:06,480
and you still press her to drink?

288
00:15:06,480 --> 00:15:07,840
Your Highness speaks wisely.

289
00:15:08,150 --> 00:15:08,960
So,

290
00:15:09,270 --> 00:15:10,600
I have prepared tea.

291
00:15:18,240 --> 00:15:19,320
Do you remember?

292
00:15:19,670 --> 00:15:21,870
This is your favorite teapot.

293
00:15:26,320 --> 00:15:27,440
Bone-Eroding Powder?

294
00:15:27,440 --> 00:15:28,670
You poisoned me!

295
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:31,200
What do you mean?

296
00:15:31,510 --> 00:15:33,910
Have I ever seen this teapot?

297
00:15:34,390 --> 00:15:36,790
Not only is the teapot the same
as that day,

298
00:15:37,030 --> 00:15:40,440
the ingredients in it are identical too.

299
00:15:40,600 --> 00:15:42,630
He dares test me with
Bone-Eroding Powder.

300
00:15:45,270 --> 00:15:46,030
I am not thirsty yet.

301
00:15:46,030 --> 00:15:48,720
That day at the Music Bureau,
I was in the wrong.

302
00:15:50,390 --> 00:15:51,630
Let me answer tea with wine

303
00:15:51,910 --> 00:15:53,120
and beg your pardon.

304
00:15:58,200 --> 00:15:59,240
You did nothing wrong.

305
00:16:00,080 --> 00:16:01,510
Will you not forgive me?

306
00:16:02,200 --> 00:16:03,000
Ying'er,

307
00:16:03,510 --> 00:16:04,840
you must drink this cup.

308
00:16:05,120 --> 00:16:07,120
Today is Qingcang's victory feast.

309
00:16:07,670 --> 00:16:09,390
You must give him that courtesy.

310
00:16:10,240 --> 00:16:11,600
Once struck by Bone-Eroding Powder,

311
00:16:11,720 --> 00:16:13,270
the limbs go weak at once.

312
00:16:13,510 --> 00:16:15,080
If no antidote is taken within a day,

313
00:16:15,200 --> 00:16:16,840
the meridians break and death follows.

314
00:16:17,240 --> 00:16:19,440
Today, you are finished.

315
00:16:20,030 --> 00:16:21,200
What are you thinking?

316
00:16:24,240 --> 00:16:25,790
I know why you will not drink.

317
00:16:26,670 --> 00:16:28,910
That day at the Music Bureau
I began to suspect

318
00:16:28,910 --> 00:16:30,200
that you, like me,

319
00:16:31,000 --> 00:16:32,390
were reborn as well.

320
00:16:33,320 --> 00:16:34,510
I must take the gamble.

321
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:37,630
What are you talking about?

322
00:16:37,720 --> 00:16:38,720
I do not follow.

323
00:16:47,720 --> 00:16:48,510
There.

324
00:16:48,870 --> 00:16:50,630
You must see my sincerity now.

325
00:16:50,630 --> 00:16:51,390
It seems

326
00:16:51,720 --> 00:16:54,200
Shen Shuying was not reborn
in this life.

327
00:16:54,200 --> 00:16:54,910
Wonderful.

328
00:16:54,910 --> 00:16:58,270
Qingcang is attentive,
Shuying sincere.

329
00:16:58,270 --> 00:16:59,510
A match made in heaven.

330
00:17:39,920 --> 00:17:44,130
♪Moonlight spills over your hand
that holds the lantern♪

331
00:17:44,690 --> 00:17:48,900
♪Light and shadow chase
across the red wall♪

332
00:17:49,330 --> 00:17:53,540
♪Past entanglements,
how do we settle the score♪

333
00:17:54,040 --> 00:17:56,120
♪If fate turns once more♪

334
00:17:56,500 --> 00:17:58,970
♪Will our endings trade places♪

335
00:17:59,190 --> 00:18:03,880
♪Restraint or drawing near♪

336
00:18:03,990 --> 00:18:08,070
♪Tugging back and forth
between two hearts in resonance♪

337
00:18:08,620 --> 00:18:12,130
♪What tone should I take♪

338
00:18:12,240 --> 00:18:15,240
♪To leave no trace♪

339
00:18:15,380 --> 00:18:17,830
♪How can I keep my head clear♪

340
00:18:18,210 --> 00:18:22,540
♪But the moment you come close♪

341
00:18:23,040 --> 00:18:27,190
♪You burn through the distance
I fought to keep♪

342
00:18:27,680 --> 00:18:30,050
♪The lamplight flickers♪

343
00:18:30,050 --> 00:18:32,490
♪Like your eyes♪

344
00:18:32,560 --> 00:18:35,990
♪Already written into my fate♪

345
00:18:51,740 --> 00:18:56,080
♪Something in my chest draws me near♪

346
00:18:56,440 --> 00:19:00,810
♪Like a silhouette, I move toward you♪

347
00:19:01,190 --> 00:19:05,610
♪The past lingers on,
yet my heart is in turmoil♪

348
00:19:05,950 --> 00:19:08,270
♪A test used as an excuse♪

349
00:19:08,270 --> 00:19:11,110
♪To stir the waters♪

350
00:19:11,110 --> 00:19:15,280
♪But the moment you come close♪

351
00:19:15,420 --> 00:19:20,160
♪You burn through the distance
I fought to keep♪

352
00:19:20,310 --> 00:19:22,660
♪The lamplight flickers♪

353
00:19:22,830 --> 00:19:25,090
♪Like your eyes♪

354
00:19:25,090 --> 00:19:29,550
♪Already written into my fate♪
